{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52652","headline":"同前 · 杨潜","name":"同前","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"（上缺）□□□□抚，幽岩有□香。\n□□□□□，□□舞□庄。\n□□□□□，□□□□□。\n□□□□化，叨毗制锦□。\n□□□□□，□□□□阳。\n（同前）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨潜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52652.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52652","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}